name=Axion Super Power Saving
version=v3.7.0
versionCode=58
author=Axion SPSM
description=v3.7.0 the mode is usable from anywhere: the Quick Settings tile really toggles (tap enters or exits - the app never opens; long-press opens Options), the exit runs its reverts side by side so it is as fast as the installer's own revert, and the status bar is simply kept visible - the switch is gone. The Recents button stays the phone's own; this mode's list is one Home tap away, with its button on the home screen. RMX3430.
